```Credential Registry Hive Saved via reg.exe | sigma: rules/windows/credential_access/proc_creation_reg_save_credential_hives.yml```
`dac_windows_process_creation` Image="*\\reg.exe" OR OriginalFileName="reg.exe" CommandLine IN ("* save *", "* export *") CommandLine IN ("*hklm\\sam *", "*hklm\\sam\"*", "*hkey_local_machine\\sam *", "*hkey_local_machine\\sam\"*", "*hklm\\security *", "*hklm\\security\"*", "*hkey_local_machine\\security *", "*hkey_local_machine\\security\"*", "*hklm\\system *", "*hklm\\system\"*", "*hkey_local_machine\\system *", "*hkey_local_machine\\system\"*")
